sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Viajante
    participant Web as Frontend (RoutePlanner)
    participant API as Backend (routeController)
    participant Svc as routeService
    participant Neo as Neo4j
    participant OSRM

    V->>Web: seleciona paradas, partida e algoritmo
    Web->>API: POST /routes/solve {stopIds, startId, algorithm}
    API->>Svc: solveRoute(input)
    Svc->>Neo: MATCH (Distillery) WHERE id IN stopIds
    Neo-->>Svc: paradas encontradas
    Svc->>Neo: point.distance() par a par entre paradas
    Neo-->>Svc: matriz de distancias (metros)
    Svc->>Svc: aplica fator rodoviario (1.27x)
    Svc->>Svc: nearestNeighbor() + twoOpt() sobre a matriz
    Svc-->>API: RouteSolution {stops, legs, totalKm, savedKm, estimatedMinutes}
    API-->>Web: 200 OK (JSON)
    Web->>OSRM: geometria viaria da ordem calculada
    OSRM-->>Web: rota real (GeoJSON)
    Web-->>V: desenha o trajeto no mapa Leaflet
